      "purpose": "`cache` is a typed Go cache library with explicit hit, miss, stale, decode, and backend-failure semantics. It provides bounded cache-aside loading, versioned and hashed keys, strict codecs, a bounded memory backend, and native Redis and Valkey adapters. Valkey-backed caches can also publish a refresh only while a compatible distributed lease is still owned.",
